WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.800
Model duels: put two models head to head on the same question.

2
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:34.800
Type a question and start. Both answers stream in, labelled only A and B.

3
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.800
Vote for the better one, with the buttons or the keys 1 to 4. Only then do you see who was who.

4
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:51.000
The leaderboard (Elo) updates on your computer and exports to CSV, Markdown or JSONL.
